# The published set is the allowlist in package.json ("files"). npm reads this file only when that field is absent,
# so the exclusions are written here too: with "files" removed, the same internal surfaces stay out of the tarball.
# The four removals are the ones in specs/2026-10-universal-wiring Plans 1 章 5 (old --registry samples, the band mod,
# the status panel, the Dot experiments). The opencode plugin (packages/opencode-plugin) stays: src/adapters/opencode.ts
# imports it, so it is runtime, not an experiment.
